WEBVTT

1
00:00:15.267 --> 00:00:19.803
Rat sat beside Mole on the log.

2
00:00:19.804 --> 00:00:26.675
"When I c-c-called you," cried Mole, "you w-w-wouldn't listen."

3
00:00:26.676 --> 00:00:30.069
Rat patted Mole on the shoulder.

4
00:00:30.070 --> 00:00:33.944
"You d-d-didn't turn back.

5
00:00:33.945 --> 00:00:39.086
I h-h-had to leave it," cried Mole.

6
00:00:39.087 --> 00:00:44.304
"I only wanted to see my home again!"

7
00:00:44.305 --> 00:00:49.447
"I've been so selfish!" said Rat.

8
00:00:49.448 --> 00:00:52.876
"I only cared about my home by the river."

9
00:00:52.877 --> 00:00:55.278
Mole wiped his tears.

10
00:00:55.279 --> 00:00:59.677
"Well," said Rat, "we're going to find your home."

11
00:00:59.678 --> 00:01:02.204
Rat stood up.

12
00:01:02.205 --> 00:01:03.872
"Come along," he said.

13
00:01:03.873 --> 00:01:05.939
"Show me the way."

14
00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:11.000
"Oh Ratty, it's no good," said Mole.

15
00:01:11.001 --> 00:01:13.742
"It will be dark soon."

16
00:01:13.743 --> 00:01:17.872
"We will find your place," Rat said.

17
00:01:17.873 --> 00:01:20.806
"Even if we stay out all night."

18
00:01:20.807 --> 00:01:28.315
Rat took Mole's arm, and they walked back.

19
00:01:28.316 --> 00:01:33.817
"I think I smell it, Rat," said Mole.

20
00:01:33.818 --> 00:01:37.940
Mole stopped and raised his nose.

21
00:01:37.941 --> 00:01:40.680
"Well?" asked Rat, excited.

22
00:01:40.681 --> 00:01:44.212
Mole sniffed his way across a field.

23
00:01:44.213 --> 00:01:48.335
He ran this way and that.

24
00:01:48.336 --> 00:01:51.671
"Have you found it, Mole?" asked Rat.

25
00:01:51.672 --> 00:01:54.868
Suddenly Mole dived.

26
00:01:54.869 --> 00:01:57.921
"Where did he go?" said Rat.

27
00:01:57.922 --> 00:02:02.543
Mole poked his head out of a small tunnel.

28
00:02:02.544 --> 00:02:07.204
"It's down here!" Mole said.

29
00:02:07.205 --> 00:02:10.869
Rat dived right behind him.

30
00:02:10.870 --> 00:02:16.422
Down the dark tunnel they went!
